    "body": "## Description\n\nUpdate the GCP CI runner image from `areal-cicd-test-20261008-454` to `areal-cicd-test-20261104-4` in both the test workflow and the default base image for future bakes. The new image is being baked from the current base with the v2.1.1 SGLang and vLLM release containers pre-pulled.\n\nBake run: https://github.com/areal-project/AReaL/actions/runs/41802514401\n\n## Related Issue\n\nFollows the v2.1.1 release in #1880. Uses the same two-file update pattern as #1829.\n\n## Type of Change\n\nCI runner image update.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] I have read the [Contributing Guide](https://github.com/areal-project/community/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [ ] Pre-commit hooks pass (`pre-commit run --all-files`)\n- [ ] Relevant tests pass; new tests added for new functionality\n- [ ] Documentation updated (if applicable; built with `./docs/build_all.sh`)\n- [x] Branch is up to date with `main`\n- [ ] Self-reviewed via `/review-pr` command\n- [x] This PR was created by a coding agent via `/create-pr`\n- [ ] This PR is a breaking change\n\n**Breaking Change Details (if applicable):** N/A\n\n## Additional Context\n\nThe targeted pre-commit hooks passed for both changed workflow files, and the commit hooks passed. The full local `pre-commit run --all-files` was attempted but stalled in the large-file check; that check passed on the changed files. Keep this PR as a draft until the bake run confirms the image exists and the GCP CI workflow is validated against it.\n",
    "changed_files": 2,
